# Sister repositories from the same work
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
#   https://github.com/NikMibu/boltz2-dude-benchmark
#     Retrospective validation of Boltz-2 affinity prediction on DUD-E for the
#     same target. Answers whether the ranking this repository produces can be
#     trusted at all.
#
#   https://github.com/NikMibu/plip_constraints_pipeline
#     The same constraint idea benchmarked against 200 experimental co-crystal
#     structures, where the true pose is known and RMSD can be measured.
